e automatizar changelogs.","ru":"Этот навык стандартизирует сообщения коммитов с использованием формата Conventional Commits, определяя типы, такие как `feat` для функций и `fix` для исправлений. Важно для поддержания ясной истории проекта и автоматизации changelogs.","ar":"تحدد هذه المهارة رسائل الـ Commit باستخدام تنسيق Conventional Commits، مع تعريف أنواع مثل `feat` للميزات و`fix` للإصلاحات. إنه ضروري للحفاظ على سجل مشروع واضح وأتمتة سجلات التغيير (changelogs)."},"seo":{"title":{"en":"commit: Conventional Commits Setup Guide | AI Agent Skill","zh":"Commit Setup Guide - Tacocat Gallery Static SPA Website H...","ja":"Commit のベストプラクティス - AIエージェントによるTacocat Gallery 静的SPAサイトホス...","ko":"Commit 설정 가이드 - 타코캣 갤러리 정적 SPA 웹사이트 호스팅","es":"Guía de Conventional Commits: Mejora tus mensajes de commit","fr":"Guide des Conventional Commits : Maîtriser vos messages d...","de":"Conventional Commits Leitfaden: Commit-Nachrichten optimi...","pt":"Commit Messages: Guia de Convenções para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Сообщения коммитов: руководство по Conventional Commits д...","ar":"رسائل الـ Commit: دليل استخدام Conventional Commits للمطورين"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to use commit with Conventional Commits format for efficient code management. Discover the benefits and get started with our expert guide.","zh":"了解 Commit 的技术细节和最佳实践，实现 Tacocat Gallery 静态 SPA 网站的高效托管","ja":"Commit の技術的な詳細とベストプラクティスを学び、Tacocat Gallery 静的SPAサイトの効率的なホスティングを実現する","ko":"Commit의 기술 세부 정보와 최선의 방법을 배우고 Tacocat 갤러리 정적 SPA 웹사이트의 효율적인 호스팅을 구현하세요","es":"Aprende a usar Conventional Commits para mensajes estructurados. Tipos como feat, fix, docs. Mejora la legibilidad y el versionado semántico en tus proyectos...","fr":"Utilisez Conventional Commits pour des messages structurés. Types feat, fix, docs. Améliorez la lisibilité et le versioning sémantique avec des outils IA.","de":"Verwende Conventional Commits für strukturierte Nachrichten. Typen wie feat, fix, docs. Verbessere Lesbarkeit und semantische Versionierung mit KI-Tools.","pt":"Aprenda a usar Conventional Commits para padronizar mensagens de commit. Inclui tipos como feat, fix, docs e chore para melhor rastreabilidade e CI/CD.","ru":"Узнайте, как использовать Conventional Commits для стандартизации сообщений коммитов. Включает типы feat, fix, docs и chore для улучшения отслеживаемости и C...","ar":"تعلم كيفية استخدام Conventional Commits لتوحيد رسائل الـ Commit. يتضمن أنواعًا مثل feat وfix وdocs وchore لتحقيق إمكانية تتبع أفضل وCI/CD."},"definition":{"en":"commit is a skill that utilizes Conventional Commits format for standardized commit messages, enhancing code readability and collaboration.","zh":"Commit 是一个使用特定格式的静态 SPA 网站托管工具","ja":"Commit は特定の形式を使用する静的 SPA サイト ホスティング ツールです","ko":"Commit은 특정 형식을 사용하는 정적 SPA 웹사이트 호스팅 도구입니다","es":"Conventional Commits es una especificación para agregar significado humano y máquina a los mensajes de commit. Sigue el formato `<tipo>(<ámbito>): <descripción>` para estandarizar el historial de commits y automatizar CHANGELOGs.","fr":"Conventional Commits est une spécification pour ajouter un sens humain et machine aux messages de commit. Il suit le format `<type>(<scope>): <description>` pour standardiser l''historique et automatiser les CHANGELOGs.","de":"Conventional Commits ist eine Spezifikation, um Commit-Nachrichten menschlich und maschinell lesbar zu machen. Es folgt dem Format `<type>(<scope>): <description>`, um die Historie zu standardisieren und CHANGELOGs zu automatisieren.","pt":"Um padrão para mensagens de commit que segue a especificação Conventional Commits. Define uma estrutura com tipo, escopo opcional e descrição para melhorar a clareza do histórico do versionamento e permitir a automação de ferramentas.","ru":"Стандарт для сообщений коммитов, следующий спецификации Conventional Commits. Определяет структуру с типом, необязательной областью и описанием для улучшения ясности истории версий и автоматизации инструментов.","ar":"معيار لرسائل الـ Commit يتبع مواصفات Conventional Commits. يحدد هيكلًا يتضمن النوع والنطاق الاختياري والوصف لتحسين وضوح سجل الإصدارات وتمكين أتمتة الأدوات."},"features":{"en":["Supports Conventional Commits format for consistent commit messages","Includes feat type for user-facing features and behavior changes","Enables fix type for efficient bug fixes and production code updates","Provides docs type for documentation-only changes","Allows style type for code style and formatting adjustments","Includes refactor type for code restructuring without behavior changes"],"zh":["支持 Conventional Commits 格式","实现 Tacocat Gallery 静态 SPA 网站托管","提供 feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、test 和 chore 类型的 Commit 消息","支持可选的正文内容","使用特定的格式来规范 Commit 消息"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 形式をサポート","Tacocat Gallery 静的 SPA サイトのホスティングを実現","feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、test と chore タイプの Commit メッセージを提供","オプションの本文コンテンツをサポート","特定の形式を使用して Commit メッセージを規範化"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식을 지원","Tacocat 갤러리 정적 SPA 웹사이트 호스팅을 구현","feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test 및 chore 유형의 Commit 메시지를 제공","선택적인 본문 내용을 지원","특정 형식을 사용하여 Commit 메시지를 규범화"],"es":["Formato estructurado: `<tipo>(<ámbito>): <descripción>`","Tipos predefinidos: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore","Distinción clara entre cambios de código de producción (feat/fix) y otros","Facilita la generación automática de CHANGELOGs y el versionado semántico","Mejora la legibilidad del historial de Git para equipos y herramientas IA","Integración con herramientas de CI/CD para flujos de trabajo automatizados"],"fr":["Format structuré : `<type>(<scope>): <description>`","Types prédéfinis : feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore","Distinction claire entre les changements de code de production (feat/fix) et autres","Facilite la génération automatique de CHANGELOGs et le versioning sémantique","Améliore la lisibilité de l''historique Git pour les équipes et outils IA","Intégration avec les outils CI/CD pour les workflows automatisés"],"de":["Strukturiertes Format: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`","Vordefinierte Typen: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore","Klar unterscheidet zwischen Produktionscode-Änderungen (feat/fix) und anderen","Ermöglicht automatische CHANGELOG-Generierung und semantische Versionierung","Verbessert die Lesbarkeit des Git-Verlaufs für Teams und KI-Tools","Integration mit CI/CD-Tools für automatisierte Workflows"],"pt":["Formato Conventional Commits: `<tipo>(<escopo>): <descrição>`","Tipos padronizados: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`","`feat` para novas funcionalidades visíveis ao usuário","`fix` para correções de bugs no código de produção","`chore` para tarefas de CI/CD e ferramentas","`docs` para alterações exclusivas de documentação"],"ru":["Формат Conventional Commits: `<тип>(<область>): <описание>`","Стандартизированные типы: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`","`feat` для новых пользовательских функций","`fix` для исправления ошибок в рабочем коде","`chore` для задач CI/CD и инструментов","`docs` для изменений только в документации"],"ar":["تنسيق Conventional Commits: `<النوع>(<النطاق>): <الوصف>`","أنواع موحدة: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `style`, `refactor`, `test`, `chore`","`feat` للميزات الجديدة الموجهة للمستخدم","`fix` لإصلاح الأخطاء في كود الإنتاج","`chore` لمهام CI/CD والأدوات","`docs` للتغييرات على التوثيق فقط"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use commit","Conventional Commits tutorial","commit alternative","commit vs semantic release","commit install guide","commit setup for static SPA","what is commit","commit best practices","commit for AI agents"],"zh":["Commit","Conventional Commits","Tacocat Gallery","静态 SPA 网站托管","Commit 消息格式","feat Commit","fix Commit","docs Commit"],"ja":["Commit","Conventional Commits","Tacocat Gallery","静的 SPA サイト ホスティング","Commit メッセージ形式","feat Commit","fix Commit","docs Commit","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Commit","Conventional Commits","Tacocat 갤러리","정적 SPA 웹사이트 호스팅","Commit 메시지 형식","feat Commit","fix Commit","docs Commit","AI 도구"],"es":["conventional commits","mensajes de commit","formato commit semántico","tipos de commit feat fix","automatizar changelog","mejores prácticas git","versionado semántico commits","AI Agents para desarrollo"],"fr":["conventional commits","messages de commit","format commit sémantique","types commit feat fix","automatiser changelog","bonnes pratiques git","versioning sémantique commits","outils IA pour développement"],"de":["conventional commits","commit nachrichten","semantisches commit format","commit typen feat fix","changelog automatisieren","git best practices","semantische versionierung commits","KI-Tools für Entwicklung"],"pt":["conventional commits","padrão mensagens commit","tipo feat commit","automatizar changelog","melhores práticas git","CI/CD com commits","escopo commit","commit semântico"],"ru":["conventional commits","стандарт сообщений коммитов","тип feat коммит","автоматизация changelog","лучшие практики git","CI/CD с коммитами","область коммита","семантический коммит"],"ar":["conventional commits","معيار رسائل commit","نوع feat commit","أتمتة سجل التغييرات changelog","أفضل ممارسات git","CI/CD مع الـ commits","نطاق commit","commit دلالي"]}},"owner":"deanmoses","repo":"tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws","repoPath":"deanmoses/tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.299Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Generates commit messages and creates commits. Use when writing commit messages, committing changes, or reviewing staged changes.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Messages\n\nUse [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format.\n\n## Format\n\n```text\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat`: User-facing features or behavior changes (must change production code)\n- `fix`: Bug fixes (must change production code)\n- `docs`: Documentation only\n- `style`: Code style/formatting (no logic changes)\n- `refactor`: Code restructuring without behavior change\n- `test`: Adding or updating tests\n- `chore`: CI/CD, tool","body":"# Commit Messages\n\nUse [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format.\n\n## Format\n\n```text\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat`: User-facing features or behavior changes (must change production code)\n- `fix`: Bug fixes (must change production code)\n- `docs`: Documentation only\n- `style`: Code style/formatting (no logic changes)\n- `refactor`: Code restructuring without behavior change\n- `test`: Adding or updating tests\n- `chore`: CI/CD, tooling, dependency bumps, configs (no production code)\n\n## Scopes\n\nOptional. Use when it adds clarity. Examples: `cloudfront`, `s3`, `ci`.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nUse `!` suffix: `feat!: remove deprecated resource`\n\n## Examples\n\n```text\nfeat(cloudfront): add immutable cache headers\nfix: correct CloudFront Function ARN attribute\nchore: add husky pre-commit hooks\ndocs: update architecture documentation\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `git diff --staged` to see staged changes\n2. Analyze the changes and determine the appropriate type\n3. Write a concise description (under 72 characters)\n4. Add body only if the \"why\" isn''t obvious from the description\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:53.625Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Management Agents requiring standardized commit message formatting using Conventional Commits","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Conventional Commits 进行标准化提交消息格式化的代码管理 Agent","ja":"Conventional Commits を使用した標準化されたコミットメッセージのフォーマットを必要とするコード管理 Agent に最適です","ko":"Conventional Commits를 사용하여 표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식이 필요한 코드 관리 Agent에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de código que requieren un formato estandarizado de mensajes de commit utilizando Conventional Commits","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un formatage standardisé des messages de commit à l''aide de Conventional Commits","de":"Ideal für Code-Management-Agents, die eine standardisierte Formatierung von Commit-Nachrichten mit Conventional Commits benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que exigem formatação de mensagens de commit padronizadas usando Conventional Commits","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированного форматирования сообщений о фиксации с использованием Conventional Commits","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشفرة الذي يتطلب تنسيق رسائل الالتزام الموحدة باستخدام Conventional Commits"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage code changes efficiently with feat, fix, and docs types, supporting Conventional Commits format for clear version control, utilizing commit types like style, refactor, test, and chore for comprehensive project management","zh":"使 Agent 能够使用 feat、fix 和 docs 等类型高效管理代码变更，支持 Conventional Commits 格式以实现清晰的版本控制，并利用 style、refactor、test 和 chore 等提交类型进行全面的项目管理","ja":"feat、fix、docs などのタイプを使用してコード変更を効率的に管理し、明確なバージョン管理のための Conventional Commits フォーマットをサポートし、style、refactor、test、chore などのコミットタイプを利用して包括的なプロジェクト管理を実現するように Agent を強化します","ko":"feat, fix, docs 유형을 사용하여 코드 변경을 효율적으로 관리하고, 명확한 버전 관리를 위한 Conventional Commits 형식을 지원하며, style, refactor, test, chore와 같은 커밋 유형을 활용하여 포괄적인 프로젝트 관리가 가능하도록 Agent에 권한을 부여합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar los cambios de código de manera eficiente con tipos feat, fix y docs, admitiendo el formato Conventional Commits para un control de versiones claro, utilizando tipos de commit como style, refactor, test y chore para una gestión de proyectos integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les modifications de code avec les types feat, fix et docs, en prenant en charge le format Conventional Commits pour un contrôle de version clair, utilisant des types de commit comme style, refactor, test et chore pour une gestion de projet complète","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Codeänderungen effizient mit den Typen feat, fix und docs zu verwalten, unterstützt das Conventional Commits-Format für eine klare Versionskontrolle und verwendet Commit-Typen wie style, refactor, test und chore für ein umfassendes Projektmanagement","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar alterações de código de forma eficiente com tipos feat, fix e docs, suportando o formato Conventional Commits para controle de versão claro, utilizando tipos de commit como style, refactor, test e chore para gerenciamento de projeto abrangente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять изменениями кода с помощью типов feat, fix и docs, поддерживая формат Conventional Commits для ясного контроля версий, используя типы коммитов, такие как style, refactor, test и chore для всестороннего управления проектом","ar":"يمكن للعميل إدارة التغييرات في الشفرة بفعالية باستخدام أنواع feat و fix و docs ، مع دعم صيغة Conventional Commits للتحكم في الإصدارات بوضوح ، واستخدام أنواع الالتزام مثل style و refactor و test و chore لإدارة مشروع شاملة"},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit messages for team projects","Automating changelog generation with Conventional Commits","Streamlining code review processes with clear commit descriptions"],"zh":["为团队项目标准化提交消息","使用 Conventional Commits 自动化生成变更日志","通过清晰的提交描述简化代码审查流程"],"ja":["チームプロジェクトのためのコミットメッセージの標準化","Conventional Commits を使用した変更ログの自動生成","明確なコミット説明によるコードレビュープロセスの効率化"],"ko":["팀 프로젝트를 위한 커밋 메시지 표준화","Conventional Commits를 사용한 변경 로그 생성 자동화","명확한 커밋 설명으로 코드 검토 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Estandarización de mensajes de commit para proyectos de equipo","Automatización de la generación de changelogs con Conventional Commits","Agilización de los procesos de revisión de código con descripciones de commit claras"],"fr":["Standardisation des messages de commit pour les projets d''équipe","Automatisation de la génération de changelogs avec Conventional Commits","Rationalisation des processus de revue de code avec des descriptions de commit claires"],"de":["Standardisierung von Commit-Nachrichten für Teamprojekte","Automatisierung der Changelog-Generierung mit Conventional Commits","Straffung von Code-Review-Prozessen mit klaren Commit-Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Padronizar mensagens de commit para projetos de equipe","Automatizar a geração de registros de alterações com Conventional Commits","Otimizar processos de revisão de código com descrições de commit claras"],"ru":["Стандартизировать сообщения о фиксации для командных проектов","Автоматизировать генерацию журналов изменений с помощью Conventional Commits","Оптимизировать процессы проверки кода с помощью ясных описаний коммитов"],"ar":["توسيط رسائل الالتزام لمشاريع الفريق","تأتمتة إنشاء سجلات التغييرات باستخدام Conventional Commits","جعل عمليات مراجعة الشفرة أكثر كفاءة مع وصفات الالتزام الواضحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits format","Limited to text-based commit messages"],"zh":["需要遵循 Conventional Commits 格式","仅限于基于文本的提交消息"],"ja":["Conventional Commits フォーマットへの準拠が必要","テキストベースのコミットメッセージに限定される"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식을 준수해야 함","텍스트 기반 커밋 메시지로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al formato Conventional Commits","Limitado a mensajes de commit basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect du format Conventional Commits","Limité aux messages de commit basés sur du texte"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des Conventional Commits-Formats","Beschränkt auf textbasierte Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["Exige aderência ao formato Conventional Commits","Limitado a mensagens de commit baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения формата Conventional Commits","Ограничен сообщениями о фиксации на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بصيغة Conventional Commits","محدود بالرسائل النصية للاستلام"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1fdb756df52d26104a1bba6bdb6a626ee22d74af8ace40af3d9094be22de24ba","qualityScore":51}');
