INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('notum-cz/strapi-next-monorepo-starter/add-locale', 'add-locale', 'notum-cz', 'strapi-next-monorepo-starter', 'community', 'add-locale notum-cz strapi-next-monorepo-starter community The add-locale skill helps developers add a new language/locale to their Strapi projects, combining Strapi admin config, Next.js i18n routing, and translation files. It benefits developers working with Strapi and NextJS. add-locale技能提供了添加新语言和本地化设置到Strapi项目的解决方案，包括Strapi admin配置、Next.js i18n路由和翻译文件 add-localeスキルは、Strapiプロジェクトに新しい言語とローカライズ設定を追加するための解決策を提供します。Strapi admin設定、Next.js i18nルーティング、翻訳ファイルが含まれます add-locale 스킬은 스트라피 프로젝트에 새로운 언어와 로컬라이제이션 설정을 추가하는 솔루션을 제공합니다. 스트라피 관리자 설정, Next.js i18n 라우팅, 번역 파일이 포함됩니다 Add-locale es una herramienta para agregar un nuevo idioma a tu aplicación, compatible con Strapi y Next.js Add-locale est un outil pour ajouter une nouvelle langue à votre application, compatible avec Strapi et Next.js Add-locale ist ein Tool, um eine neue Sprache zu Ihrer Anwendung hinzuzufügen, kompatibel mit Strapi und Next.js O add-locale é uma ferramenta para adicionar novos idiomas ao seu projeto, utilizando Strapi e Next.js. add-locale - это инструмент для добавления новых языков в ваш проект, использующий Strapi и Next.js. add-locale هو أداة لإضافة لغات جديدة إلى مشروعك، باستخدام Strapi و Next.js. how to use add-locale add-locale setup guide Strapi locale setup Next.js i18n routing add-locale alternative add-locale vs locale-plugin install add-locale add-locale tutorial what is add-locale add-locale documentation add-locale Strapi Next.js i18n 本地化设置 语言支持 区域代码 区域名称 Validates locale code using ISO 639-1 format Supports Next.js i18n routing for multilingual projects Generates translation files for added locales Configures Strapi admin for new language/locale Rejects invalid locale codes and names Asks for user input for locale code and name add-locale is a skill that enables developers to add a new language/locale to their Strapi projects, involving Strapi admin config, Next.js i18n routing, and translation files.');
