deployment in CI mode with `--ci` flag","Allows detachment with `--detach` flag","Supports deployment of local code changes"],"zh":["使用 `railway up` 命令部署代码","支持提交消息和 CI 模式","可以修复部署过程中的问题","支持使用 `-m` 标志指定提交消息","可以使用 `--detach` 参数部署代码"],"ja":["コードをデプロイするために `railway up` コマンドを使用","コミットメッセージと CI モードをサポート","デプロイ中に発生した問題を修正","-m フラグを使用してコミットメッセージを指定","--detach パラメータを使用してコードをデプロイ"],"ko":["코드를 배포하기 위해 `railway up` 명령을 사용","커밋 메시지와 CI 모드를 지원","배포 중에 발생한 문제를 수정","-m 플래그를 사용하여 커밋 메시지를 지정","--detach 매개 변수를 사용하여 코드를 배포"],"es":["Uso de railway up para deployar código","Opción --detach para deployar en segundo plano","Uso del flag -m para commit messages descriptivos","Compatibilidad con deploy de cambios locales","Opción --ci para deployar y solucionar problemas"],"fr":["Utilisation de railway up pour déployer du code","Option --detach pour déployer en arrière-plan","Utilisation du flag -m pour des messages de commit descriptifs","Compatibilité avec le déploiement de modifications locales","Option --ci pour déployer et résoudre les problèmes"],"de":["Verwendung von railway up zum Deployen von Code","Option --detach zum Deployen im Hintergrund","Verwendung des Flags -m für beschreibende Commit-Mitteilungen","Kompatibilität mit dem Deployen lokaler Änderungen","Option --ci zum Deployen und zur Lösung von Problemen"],"pt":["Uso do comando railway up para implantar código","Suporte a deploy de código local","Opção de usar o modo --ci para deploy e correção de erros","Necessidade de usar a flag -m com uma mensagem de commit descritiva","Compatibilidade com o CLI de Railway"],"ru":["Использование команды railway up для развертывания кода","Поддержка развертывания локального кода","Возможность использования режима --ci для deploy и исправления ошибок","Необходимость использования флага -m с описательным сообщением коммита","Совместимость с CLI Railway"],"ar":["استخدام الأمر railway up لنشر الكود","دعم نشر الكود المحلي","خيار استخدام الوضع --ci لنشر وتصحيح الأخطاء","ضرورة استخدام العلامة -m مع رسالة التزام وصفية","توافق مع CLI Railway"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use deploy","what is deploy","deploy to Railway","railway up command","deploy alternative","deploy vs Git","deploy install","deploy setup guide","CI mode deployment"],"zh":["Railway Up","部署代码","提交消息","CI 模式","代码部署","Railway 部署","AI エージェント","部署设置"],"ja":["Railway Up","コードデプロイ","コミットメッセージ","CI モード","コードアップロード","Railway デプロイ","AIエージェント","デプロイ設定"],"ko":["Railway Up","코드 배포","커밋 메시지","CI 모드","코드 업로드","Railway 배포","AI 에이전트","배포 설정"],"es":["deploy en Railway","railway up","commit messages descriptivos","deploy de cambios locales","herramientas de deploy","mejores prácticas de deploy","Agente de Inteligencia Artificial para deploy"],"fr":["déploiement sur Railway","railway up","messages de commit descriptifs","déploiement de modifications locales","outils de déploiement","meilleures pratiques de déploiement","Outil d''Intelligence Artificielle pour le déploiement"],"de":["Deploy in Railway","railway up","beschreibende Commit-Mitteilungen","Deployen lokaler Änderungen","Deploy-Tools","beste Praktiken für das Deployen","Künstliche Intelligenz-Tool für das Deployen"],"pt":["deploy com railway","railway up","implantar código","deploy de código local","modo --ci","flag -m","CLI de railway","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["deploy с помощью railway","railway up","развертывание кода","развертывание локального кода","режим --ci","флаг -m","CLI railway","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["نشر مع railway","railway up","نشر الكود","نشر الكود المحلي","الوضع --ci","العلامة -m","CLI railway","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"matixlol","repo":"monitoreo-panama","repoPath":"matixlol/monitoreo-panama","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.338Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to push code to Railway, says railway up, deploy, deploy to railway, ship, or push. For initial setup or creating services, use new skill. For Docker images, use environment skill.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- De","body":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- Describe what changed: \"Fix memory leak in worker process\"\n- Reference tickets/issues: \"Implement feature #123\"\n- Be concise but meaningful: \"Update deps and fix build warnings\"\n\n## Modes\n\n### Detach Mode (default)\nStarts deploy and returns immediately. Use for most deploys.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n### CI Mode\nStreams build logs until complete. Use when user wants to watch the build or needs to debug issues.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --ci -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n**When to use CI mode:**\n- User says \"deploy and watch\", \"deploy and fix issues\"\n- User is debugging build failures\n- User wants to see build output\n\n## Deploy Specific Service\n\nDefault is linked service. To deploy to a different service:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach --service backend -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n## Deploy to Unlinked Project\n\nDeploy to a project without linking first:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --project <project-id> --environment production --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\nRequires both `--project` and `--environment` flags.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-m, --message <MSG>` | Commit message describing the deploy (always use this) |\n| `-d, --detach` | Don''t attach to logs (default) |\n| `-c, --ci` | Stream build logs, exit when done |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `-e, --environment <NAME>` | Target environment (defaults to linked) |\n| `-p, --project <ID>` | Target project (requires --environment) |\n| `[PATH]` | Path to deploy (defaults to current directory) |\n\n## Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks UP the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory of a linked project, you don''t need to relink.\n\nFor subdirectory deployments, prefer setting `rootDirectory` via the environment skill, then deploy normally with `railway up`.\n\n## After Deploy\n\n### Detach mode\n```\nDeploying to <service>...\n```\nUse `deployment` skill to check build status (with `--lines` flag).\n\n### CI mode\nBuild logs stream inline. If build fails, the error will be in the output.\n\n**Do NOT run `railway logs --build` after CI mode** - the logs already streamed. If you need\nmore context, use `deployment` skill with `--lines` flag (never stream).\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Check status after deploy**: Use `service` skill\n- **View logs**: Use `deployment` skill\n- **Fix config issues**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Redeploy after config fix**: Use `environment` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Project Linked\n```\nNo Railway project linked. Run `railway link` first.\n```\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Build Failure (CI mode)\nThe build logs already streamed - analyze them directly from the `railway up --ci` output.\nDo NOT run `railway logs` after CI mode (it streams forever without `--lines`).\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing dependencies → check package.json/requirements.txt\n- Build command wrong → use environment skill to fix\n- Dockerfile issues → check dockerfile path\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:23.672Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing streamlined code deployment to Railway.","zh":"非常适合需要将代码部署到 Railway 的开发代理的流畅代码部署","ja":"Railway へのコードデプロイを簡素化する必要がある開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Railway에 대한 코드 배포를 간소화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una implementación de código simplificada en Railway.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''un déploiement de code simplifié sur Railway.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine vereinfachte Codebereitstellung in Railway benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de implantação de código otimizada para Railway.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуется оптимизированная развертка кода в Railway.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير العاملين الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر كود مبسط إلى Railway."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy local code changes to Railway using `railway up`, providing efficient deployment and potential issue resolution with --ci mode, all while maintaining descriptive commit messages with the `-m` flag.","zh":"赋予代理使用 `railway up` 将本地代码更改部署到 Railway 的能力，提供高效的部署和使用 --ci 模式的潜在问题解决，同时使用 `-m` 标志维护描述性的提交消息","ja":"`railway up` を使用してローカルのコード変更を Railway にデプロイするエージェントをEmpowerし、効率的なデプロイと --ci モードでの潜在的な問題解決を提供し、同時に `-m` フラグを使用して記述的なコミットメッセージを維持","ko":"`railway up`을 사용하여 로컬 코드 변경을 Railway에 배포할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 효율적인 배포와 --ci 모드에서 잠재적인 문제 해결을 제공하고 동시에 `-m` 플래그를 사용하여 설명적인 커밋 메시지를 유지","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar cambios de código locales en Railway usando `railway up`, proporcionando una implementación eficiente y una posible resolución de problemas con el modo --ci, todo mientras mantiene mensajes de confirmación descriptivos con la bandera `-m`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des modifications de code locales sur Railway en utilisant `railway up`, fournissant un déploiement efficace et une éventuelle résolution de problèmes avec le mode --ci, tout en maintenant des messages de validation descriptifs avec le drapeau `-m`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, lokale Codeänderungen auf Railway mit `railway up` zu bereitstellen, wodurch eine effiziente Bereitstellung und eine mögliche Problemlösung mit dem --ci-Modus ermöglicht wird, während gleichzeitig beschreibende Commit-Nachrichten mit der `-m`-Flag erhalten bleiben.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem alterações de código locais no Railway usando `railway up`, fornecendo implantação eficiente e resolução potencial de problemas com o modo --ci, mantendo sempre mensagens de commit descritivas com a flag `-m`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать локальные изменения кода в Railway с помощью `railway up`, обеспечивая эффективную развертку и потенциальное решение проблем с режимом --ci, сохраняя при этом описательные сообщения коммитов с флагом `-m`.","ar":"يمكن للعاملين نشر التغييرات المحلية في الكود إلى Railway باستخدام `railway up` ، مما يوفر نشرًا فعالًا و حلًا محتملًا للمشكلات مع وضع --ci ، مع الحفاظ على رسائل الالتزام الوصفية باستخدام علم `-m`."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying updated application code","Shipping new features to Railway","Pushing local code fixes"],"zh":["将更新的应用程序代码部署到 Railway","将新功能交付到 Railway","将本地代码修复推送到 Railway"],"ja":["更新されたアプリケーションコードを Railway にデプロイ","新しい機能を Railway に配信","ローカルのコード修正を Railway にプッシュ"],"ko":["갱신된 애플리케이션 코드를 Railway에 배포","새로운 기능을 Railway에 전달","로컬 코드 수정을 Railway에 푸시"],"es":["Implementar código de aplicación actualizado","Enviar nuevas características a Railway","Enviar correcciones de código locales"],"fr":["Déployer le code d''application mis à jour","Expédier de nouvelles fonctionnalités à Railway","Expédier des correctifs de code locaux"],"de":["Aktualisierten Anwendungscode bereitstellen","Neue Funktionen an Railway liefern","Lokale Codekorrekturen übertragen"],"pt":["Implantação de código de aplicação atualizado","Envio de novos recursos para Railway","Envio de correções de código locais"],"ru":["Развертка обновленного кода приложения","Отправка новых функций в Railway","Отправка локальных исправлений кода"],"ar":["نشر كود تطبيق محدث","شحن ميزات جديدة إلى Railway","نشر تصحيحات كود محلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway setup","Limited to deploying from the current directory","Needs `railway up` command-line tool installed"],"zh":["需要 Railway 设置","仅限从当前目录部署","需要 `railway up` 命令行工具安装"],"ja":["Railway の設定が必要","現在のディレクトリからのデプロイのみ","`railway up` コマンドラインツールのインストールが必要"],"ko":["Railway 설정이 필요","현재 디렉토리로부터의 배포만","`railway up` 명령줄 도구가 설치되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Railway","Limitado a la implementación desde el directorio actual","Requiere la herramienta de línea de comandos `railway up` instalada"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Railway","Limité au déploiement depuis le répertoire actuel","Nécessite l''outil de ligne de commande `railway up` installé"],"de":["Benötigt Railway-Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf die Bereitstellung aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis","Benötigt das Kommandozeilen-Tool `railway up` installiert"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Railway","Limitado à implantação do diretório atual","Necessita da ferramenta de linha de comando `railway up` instalada"],"ru":["Требуется настройка Railway","Ограничен разверткой из текущего каталога","Требуется установка инструмента командной строки `railway up`"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Railway","محدود بنشر الدليل الحالي","يحتاج إلى أداة سطر الأوامر `railway up` المثبتة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"8f76d1c79c47ec542bf17ac0ce554b560930e25f673f2ed74c7ed02a8619671f","qualityScore":51}');
