éveloppement","outils d''IA pour le développement"],"de":["sm-configure","Konfiguration von SourceMonitor","Konfigurations-DSL","Software-Entwicklung","Projekt-Konfiguration","umgebungsspezifische Einstellungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Konfiguration","Entwicklertools","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung"],"pt":["sm-configure","configuração do SourceMonitor","otimização do desempenho","configuração de ambiente","depuração de configuração","linguagem de configuração","SourceMonitor"],"ru":["sm-configure","конфигурация SourceMonitor","оптимизация производительности","конфигурация окружения","отладка конфигурации","язык конфигурации","SourceMonitor","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["sm-configure","ضبط SourceMonitor","تحسين الأداء","إعدادات البيئة","تصحيح الإعداد","لغة الضبط","SourceMonitor","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"dchuk","repo":"source_monitor","repoPath":"dchuk/source_monitor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.349Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sm-configure","description":"Use when configuring SourceMonitor engine settings via the DSL, including queue settings, HTTP client, fetching, health, scrapers, retention, scraping controls, events, model extensions, realtime, and authentication.","bodyPreview":"# sm-configure: Engine Configuration DSL\n\nComprehensive reference for configuring SourceMonitor via `SourceMonitor.configure`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding or modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- Understanding what configuration options are available\n- Debugging configuration-related issues\n- Setting up environment-specific overrides\n\n## Configuration Entry Point\n\nAll configuration lives inside the `configure` block in the host app''s initializer:\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.co","body":"# sm-configure: Engine Configuration DSL\n\nComprehensive reference for configuring SourceMonitor via `SourceMonitor.configure`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding or modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- Understanding what configuration options are available\n- Debugging configuration-related issues\n- Setting up environment-specific overrides\n\n## Configuration Entry Point\n\nAll configuration lives inside the `configure` block in the host app''s initializer:\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.configure do |config|\n  # settings here\nend\n```\n\nAfter the block executes, `ModelExtensions.reload!` runs automatically to apply any model changes. Restart web and worker processes after changes.\n\n## Configuration Sections\n\nThe `config` object (`SourceMonitor::Configuration`) has 13 sub-sections plus top-level queue/job settings:\n\n| Section | Accessor | Class |\n|---|---|---|\n| Top-level | `config.*` | `Configuration` |\n| HTTP | `config.http` | `HTTPSettings` |\n| Fetching | `config.fetching` | `FetchingSettings` |\n| Health | `config.health` | `HealthSettings` |\n| Scrapers | `config.scrapers` | `ScraperRegistry` |\n| Retention | `config.retention` | `RetentionSettings` |\n| Scraping | `config.scraping` | `ScrapingSettings` |\n| Events | `config.events` | `Events` |\n| Models | `config.models` | `Models` |\n| Realtime | `config.realtime` | `RealtimeSettings` |\n| Authentication | `config.authentication` | `AuthenticationSettings` |\n| Images | `config.images` | `ImagesSettings` |\n| Favicons | `config.favicons` | `FaviconsSettings` |\n\nSee `reference/configuration-reference.md` for every setting with types, defaults, and examples.\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n### Queue Configuration\n```ruby\nconfig.queue_namespace = \"source_monitor\"\nconfig.fetch_queue_name = \"source_monitor_fetch\"\nconfig.fetch_queue_concurrency = 4\n```\n\n### HTTP Client\n```ruby\nconfig.http.timeout = 30\nconfig.http.proxy = ENV[\"HTTP_PROXY\"]\nconfig.http.retry_max = 3\n```\n\n### Authentication (Devise)\n```ruby\nconfig.authentication.authenticate_with :authenticate_user!\nconfig.authentication.authorize_with ->(c) { c.current_user&.admin? }\n```\n\n### Image Downloads (Active Storage)\n```ruby\nconfig.images.download_to_active_storage = true\nconfig.images.max_download_size = 5 * 1024 * 1024  # 5 MB\nconfig.images.download_timeout = 15\nconfig.images.allowed_content_types = %w[image/jpeg image/png image/webp]\n```\n\n### Events\n```ruby\nconfig.events.after_item_created { |e| Notifier.new_item(e.item) }\nconfig.events.register_item_processor ->(ctx) { Indexer.index(ctx.item) }\n```\n\n### Model Extensions\n```ruby\nconfig.models.table_name_prefix = \"sm_\"\nconfig.models.source.include_concern \"MyApp::SourceExtension\"\nconfig.models.item.validate :custom_check\n```\n\n### Favicons (Active Storage)\n```ruby\nconfig.favicons.enabled = true\nconfig.favicons.fetch_timeout = 10\nconfig.favicons.max_download_size = 512 * 1024  # 512 KB\nconfig.favicons.retry_cooldown_days = 14\n```\n\n### Realtime\n```ruby\nconfig.realtime.adapter = :redis\nconfig.realtime.redis_url = ENV[\"REDIS_URL\"]\n```\n\n## Helper APIs\n\n```ruby\nSourceMonitor.config                         # Current configuration\nSourceMonitor.configure { |c| ... }          # Set configuration\nSourceMonitor.reset_configuration!           # Revert to defaults (for tests)\nSourceMonitor.events                         # Shortcut to config.events\nSourceMonitor.queue_name(:fetch)             # Resolved queue name\nSourceMonitor.queue_concurrency(:scrape)     # Resolved concurrency\nSourceMonitor.mission_control_dashboard_path # Resolved MC path or nil\n```\n\n## Key Source Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration.rb` | Main Configuration class |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/http_settings.rb` | HTTP client settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/fetching_settings.rb` | Adaptive scheduling |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/health_settings.rb` | Health monitoring |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/scraper_registry.rb` | Scraper adapter registry |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/retention_settings.rb` | Item retention |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/scraping_settings.rb` | Scraping controls |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/events.rb` | Event callbacks |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/models.rb` | Model extensions config |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/model_definition.rb` | Per-model definition |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/realtime_settings.rb` | Action Cable settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/authentication_settings.rb` | Auth settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/images_settings.rb` | Image download settings |\n| `lib/source_monitor/configuration/validation_definition.rb` | Validation wrapper |\n\n## References\n\n- `reference/configuration-reference.md` -- Complete settings reference\n- `docs/configuration.md` -- Official configuration documentation\n- `lib/generators/source_monitor/install/templates/source_monitor.rb.tt` -- Initializer template\n\n## Testing\n\nReset configuration between tests:\n```ruby\nsetup do\n  SourceMonitor.reset_configuration!\nend\n```\n\nTest custom configuration:\n```ruby\ntest \"custom queue name\" do\n  SourceMonitor.configure do |config|\n    config.fetch_queue_name = \"custom_fetch\"\n  end\n  assert_equal \"custom_fetch\", SourceMonitor.queue_name(:fetch)\nend\n```\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Initializer exists at `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`\n- [ ] Queue names match `config/queue.yml` (or `config/solid_queue.yml`) entries\n- [x] Dispatcher config includes `recurring_schedule: config/recurring.yml` (handled by install generator)\n- [ ] Authentication hooks configured for host auth system\n- [ ] HTTP timeouts appropriate for target feeds\n- [ ] Retention policy set for production\n- [ ] Workers restarted after configuration changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:45.221Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Ruby-based AI Agents requiring advanced SourceMonitor configuration and debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 SourceMonitor 配置和调试功能的基于 Ruby 的 AI 代理。","ja":"Ruby ベースの AI エージェントが高度な SourceMonitor 構成およびデバッグ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 SourceMonitor 구성 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 Ruby 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Ruby que requieren una configuración avanzada de SourceMonitor y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Ruby nécessitant une configuration avancée de SourceMonitor et des capacités de débogage.","de":"Ideal für Ruby-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte SourceMonitor-Konfiguration und Debugging-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Ruby que exigem configuração avançada do SourceMonitor e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Ruby, требующих расширенной настройки SourceMonitor и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يستندون إلى Ruby الذين يتطلبون تكوين متقدم لبرنامج SourceMonitor وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to customize SourceMonitor settings, debug configuration-related issues, and set up environment-specific overrides using the `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL, leveraging Ruby and SourceMonitor libraries.","zh":"赋予代理自定义 SourceMonitor 设置、调试配置相关问题以及使用 `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL 设置环境特定覆盖，利用 Ruby 和 SourceMonitor 库。","ja":"エージェントに SourceMonitor 設定のカスタマイズ、構成関連の問題のデバッグ、`SourceMonitor.configure` DSL を使用した環境固有のオーバーライドの設定を可能にし、Ruby および SourceMonitor ライブラリを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 SourceMonitor 설정을 사용자 정의하고, 구성과 관련된 문제를 디버깅하며, `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL을 사용하여 환경별 오버라이드를 설정할 수 있도록 하며, Ruby 및 SourceMonitor 라이브러리를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes personalizar la configuración de SourceMonitor, depurar problemas relacionados con la configuración y establecer anulaciones específicas del entorno utilizando el lenguaje DSL `SourceMonitor.configure`, aprovechando las bibliotecas de Ruby y SourceMonitor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de personnaliser les paramètres de SourceMonitor, de déboguer les problèmes liés à la configuration et de configurer des substitutions spécifiques à l''environnement en utilisant le DSL `SourceMonitor.configure`, en exploitant les bibliothèques Ruby et SourceMonitor.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die SourceMonitor-Einstellungen anzupassen, konfigurationsbezogene Probleme zu debuggen und umgebungsbezogene Überschreibungen mit dem `SourceMonitor.configure`-DSL einzurichten, indem Ruby- und SourceMonitor-Bibliotheken genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes personalizem as configurações do SourceMonitor, depurem problemas relacionados à configuração e configurem substituições específicas do ambiente usando a linguagem de definição de serviços `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL, aproveitando as bibliotecas Ruby e SourceMonitor.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью настраивать параметры SourceMonitor, отлаживать проблемы, связанные с конфигурацией, и устанавливать переопределения, специфичные для окружения, используя язык определения услуг `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL, используя библиотеки Ruby и SourceMonitor.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تخصيص إعدادات SourceMonitor، وتصحيح مشاكل متعلقة بالتكوين، وتهيئة الإعدادات المحددة للمحيط باستخدام لغة تعريف الخدمات `SourceMonitor.configure` DSL، مستفيدة من مكتبات Ruby و SourceMonitor."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring SourceMonitor for environment-specific settings","Debugging configuration-related issues in Ruby applications","Modifying settings in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"zh":["为环境特定设置配置 SourceMonitor","在 Ruby 应用程序中调试配置相关问题","在 `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb` 中修改设置"],"ja":["環境固有の設定用に SourceMonitor を構成する","Ruby アプリケーションで構成関連の問題をデバッグする","`config/initializers/source_monitor.rb` で設定を変更する"],"ko":["환경별 설정을 위해 SourceMonitor를 구성하는 것","Ruby 애플리케이션에서 구성과 관련된 문제를 디버깅하는 것","`config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`에서 설정을 수정하는 것"],"es":["Configuración de SourceMonitor para ajustes específicos del entorno","Depuración de problemas relacionados con la configuración en aplicaciones Ruby","Modificación de ajustes en `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"fr":["Configuration de SourceMonitor pour les paramètres spécifiques à l''environnement","Débogage des problèmes liés à la configuration dans les applications Ruby","Modification des paramètres dans `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"de":["Konfiguration von SourceMonitor für umgebungsbezogene Einstellungen","Debuggen von konfigurationsbezogenen Problemen in Ruby-Anwendungen","Änderung von Einstellungen in `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"pt":["Configurando o SourceMonitor para configurações específicas do ambiente","Depurando problemas de configuração em aplicações Ruby","Modificando configurações em `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"ru":["Настройка SourceMonitor для параметров, специфичных для окружения","Отладка проблем конфигурации в приложениях Ruby","Изменение параметров в `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"],"ar":["تكوين برنامج SourceMonitor لإعدادات محددة للمحيط","تصحيح مشاكل التكوين في تطبيقات Ruby","تعديل الإعدادات في `config/initializers/source_monitor.rb`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ruby and SourceMonitor setup","Limited to SourceMonitor configuration and debugging"],"zh":["需要 Ruby 和 SourceMonitor 设置","仅限 SourceMonitor 配置和调试"],"ja":["Ruby および SourceMonitor の設定が必要","SourceMonitor 構成およびデバッグに限定"],"ko":["Ruby 및 SourceMonitor 설정이 필요함","SourceMonitor 구성 및 디버깅에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Ruby y SourceMonitor","Limitado a la configuración y depuración de SourceMonitor"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration Ruby et SourceMonitor","Limité à la configuration et au débogage de SourceMonitor"],"de":["Benötigt Ruby- und SourceMonitor-Setup","Begrenzt auf SourceMonitor-Konfiguration und -Debugging"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Ruby e do SourceMonitor","Limitado à configuração e depuração do SourceMonitor"],"ru":["Требует настройки Ruby и SourceMonitor","Ограничен настройкой и отладкой SourceMonitor"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادات Ruby و SourceMonitor","محدود بتكوين وتصحيح أخطاء SourceMonitor"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"dc4d0e4424cf77c0eed2c8de95536a6c3707a1ca45b688122f320a476212204f","qualityScore":51}');
