"JSON 형식"],"es":["API Designer","diseño de API","API RESTful","principios de diseño de API","formatos de respuesta de API","métodos HTTP","rutas de API","desarrollo de API","herramientas de API"],"fr":["API Designer","conception d''API","API RESTful","principes de conception d''API","formats de réponse d''API","méthodes HTTP","routes d''API","développement d''API","outils d''API"],"de":["API Designer","API-Entwurf","RESTful-API","API-Designprinzipien","API-Antwortformate","HTTP-Methoden","API-Routen","API-Entwicklung","API-Tools"],"pt":["API Designer","design de API RESTful","métodos HTTP","padrões de caminho","formato de resposta","integração com backend","desenvolvimento de API","ferramentas de API","melhores práticas de API"],"ru":["ИИ Агент API Designer","проектирование RESTful API","методы HTTP","шаблоны пути","формат ответа","интеграция с backend","разработка API","инструменты API","лучшие практики API"],"ar":["مصمم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات RESTful","أوامر HTTP","أنماط المسار","تنسيق الرد","التكامل مع الخلفية","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","أدوات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","أفضل الممارسات لواجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"tolluset","repo":"local-review","repoPath":"tolluset/local-review","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.351Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-designer","description":"API design and implementation. Use for API, endpoint, route requests","bodyPreview":"# API Designer Skill\n\n## Role\n\nBackend developer who designs and implements RESTful APIs\n\n## API Design Principles\n\n### RESTful Rules\n| Method | Purpose | Path Pattern |\n|--------|---------|--------------|\n| GET | Retrieve | `/api/resources`, `/api/resources/:id` |\n| POST | Create | `/api/resources` |\n| PATCH | Partial update | `/api/resources/:id` |\n| PUT | Full replace | `/api/resources/:id` |\n| DELETE | Delete | `/api/resources/:id` |\n\n### Response Format\n```typescript\n// Success\n{ data: T }","body":"# API Designer Skill\n\n## Role\n\nBackend developer who designs and implements RESTful APIs\n\n## API Design Principles\n\n### RESTful Rules\n| Method | Purpose | Path Pattern |\n|--------|---------|--------------|\n| GET | Retrieve | `/api/resources`, `/api/resources/:id` |\n| POST | Create | `/api/resources` |\n| PATCH | Partial update | `/api/resources/:id` |\n| PUT | Full replace | `/api/resources/:id` |\n| DELETE | Delete | `/api/resources/:id` |\n\n### Response Format\n```typescript\n// Success\n{ data: T }\n{ data: T[], total?: number }\n\n// Error\n{ error: string, details?: unknown }\n```\n\n### HTTP Status Codes\n| Code | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| 200 | Success |\n| 201 | Created |\n| 400 | Bad request |\n| 404 | Not found |\n| 500 | Server error |\n\n## Implementation Order\n\n### 1. Type Definition (packages/shared)\n```typescript\n// packages/shared/src/index.ts\nexport type CreateFeatureRequest = {\n  name: string;\n  description?: string;\n};\n\nexport type FeatureResponse = {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  description: string | null;\n  createdAt: string;\n};\n```\n\n### 2. DB Schema (if needed)\n```typescript\n// packages/db/src/schema.ts\nexport const features = sqliteTable(''features'', {\n  id: text(''id'').primaryKey(),\n  name: text(''name'').notNull(),\n  description: text(''description''),\n  createdAt: text(''created_at'').notNull(),\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Route Implementation\n```typescript\n// apps/server/src/routes/features.ts\nimport { Router } from ''express'';\nimport { db } from ''@local-review/db'';\nimport { features } from ''@local-review/db/schema'';\nimport { nanoid } from ''nanoid'';\n\nconst router = Router();\n\n// GET /api/features\nrouter.get(''/'', async (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const result = await db.select().from(features);\n    res.json(result);\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ error: ''Failed to fetch features'' });\n  }\n});\n\n// POST /api/features\nrouter.post(''/'', async (req, res) => {\n  try {\n    const { name, description } = req.body;\n\n    if (!name) {\n      return res.status(400).json({ error: ''Name is required'' });\n    }\n\n    const newFeature = {\n      id: nanoid(),\n      name,\n      description: description ?? null,\n      createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n    };\n\n    await db.insert(features).values(newFeature);\n    res.status(201).json(newFeature);\n  } catch (error) {\n    res.status(500).json({ error: ''Failed to create feature'' });\n  }\n});\n\nexport default router;\n```\n\n### 4. Register Route\n```typescript\n// apps/server/src/index.ts\nimport featuresRouter from ''./routes/features'';\napp.use(''/api/features'', featuresRouter);\n```\n\n### 5. Frontend API Client\n```typescript\n// apps/web/src/lib/api.ts\nexport const featureApi = {\n  list: () => fetchJson<FeatureResponse[]>(''/api/features''),\n  create: (data: CreateFeatureRequest) =>\n    fetchJson<FeatureResponse>(''/api/features'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      body: JSON.stringify(data),\n    }),\n};\n```\n\n## Existing API Reference\n\nCurrent project API structure:\n- `GET /api/git/branches` - Branch list\n- `GET/POST /api/sessions` - Session CRUD\n- `GET/POST /api/sessions/:id/comments` - Comments\n- `PATCH /api/sessions/:id/files/*/status` - File status\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:52.129Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Agents needing structured RESTful API design and implementation guidelines","zh":"非常适合需要结构化RESTful API设计和实现指南的后端代理","ja":"バックエンドエージェントが構造化されたRESTful APIの設計と実装のガイドラインを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"구조화된 RESTful API 설계 및 구현 지침이 필요한 백엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de backend que necesitan pautas de diseño e implementación de API RESTful estructuradas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de backend qui ont besoin de lignes directrices de conception et de mise en œuvre de API RESTful structurées","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Agents, die Richtlinien für das strukturierte Design und die Implementierung von RESTful-APIs benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Backend que necessitam de diretrizes de design e implementação de API RESTful estruturada","ru":"Идеально для агентов Backend, которым необходимы руководящие принципы по проектированию и реализации структурированного RESTful API","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الخلفية الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات تصميم وتنفيذ API RESTful منظم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement scalable RESTful APIs using standardized HTTP methods like GET, POST, PATCH, PUT, and DELETE, and provides a consistent response format for successful requests","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现可扩展的RESTful API的能力，使用标准的HTTP方法如GET、POST、PATCH、PUT和DELETE，并为成功的请求提供一致的响应格式","ja":"エージェントに、GET、POST、PATCH、PUT、DELETEなどの標準HTTPメソッドを使用してスケーラブルなRESTful APIを設計および実装する能力を与え、成功したリクエストのための整合性のあるレスポンス形式を提供する","ko":"에이전트가 GET, POST, PATCH, PUT 및 DELETE와 같은 표준 HTTP 메소드를 사용하여 확장 가능한 RESTful API를 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 하며, 성공한 요청에 대한 일관된 응답 형식을 제공한다","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar e implementar API RESTful escalables utilizando métodos HTTP estandarizados como GET, POST, PATCH, PUT y DELETE, y proporciona un formato de respuesta consistente para solicitudes exitosas","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des API RESTful évolutives en utilisant des méthodes HTTP standardisées comme GET, POST, PATCH, PUT et DELETE, et fournit un format de réponse cohérent pour les requêtes réussies","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, skalierbare RESTful-APIs zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem standardisierte HTTP-Methoden wie GET, POST, PATCH, PUT und DELETE verwendet werden, und bietet ein konsistentes Antwortformat für erfolgreiche Anfragen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar APIs RESTful escaláveis usando métodos HTTP padronizados como GET, POST, PATCH, PUT e DELETE, e fornece um formato de resposta consistente para solicitações bem-sucedidas","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать масштабируемые RESTful API, используя стандартизированные методы HTTP, такие как GET, POST, PATCH, PUT и DELETE, и предоставляет последовательный формат ответа для успешных запросов","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تصميم وتنفيذ APIs RESTful قابلة للتوسع باستخدام طرق HTTP معيارية مثل GET و POST و PATCH و PUT و DELETE، ويوفر تنسيق استجابة متسق للطلبات الناجحة"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing resource-oriented APIs","Implementing standardized HTTP method handling","Generating consistent API response formats"],"zh":["设计面向资源的API","实现标准化的HTTP方法处理","生成一致的API响应格式"],"ja":["リソース指向のAPIを設計する","標準化されたHTTPメソッドの処理を実装する","整合性のあるAPIレスポンス形式を生成する"],"ko":["리소스 지향 API 설계","표준화된 HTTP 메소드 처리 구현","일관된 API 응답 형식 생성"],"es":["Diseñar API orientadas a recursos","Implementar el manejo de métodos HTTP estandarizados","Generar formatos de respuesta de API coherentes"],"fr":["Concevoir des API orientées vers les ressources","Mettre en œuvre la gestion de méthodes HTTP standardisées","Générer des formats de réponse d''API cohérents"],"de":["Entwerfen von ressourcenorientierten APIs","Implementierung der Verarbeitung standardisierter HTTP-Methoden","Erzeugen konsistenter API-Antwortformate"],"pt":["Projeto de APIs orientadas a recursos","Implementação de tratamento de métodos HTTP padronizados","Geração de formatos de resposta de API consistentes"],"ru":["Проектирование API, ориентированных на ресурсы","Реализация обработки стандартизированных методов HTTP","Генерация последовательных форматов ответов API"],"ar":["تصميم APIs منظم حول الموارد","تنفيذ معالجة طرق HTTP معيارية","توليد تنسيقات استجابة API متسقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to RESTful API design principles","Does not support other API design styles like GraphQL"],"zh":["仅限RESTful API设计原则","不支持其他API设计风格，如GraphQL"],"ja":["RESTful API設計原則のみ","GraphQLなどの他のAPI設計スタイルはサポートしない"],"ko":["RESTful API 설계 원칙만","GraphQL 등의 다른 API 설계 스타일을 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Limitado a los principios de diseño de API RESTful","No admite otros estilos de diseño de API como GraphQL"],"fr":["Limité aux principes de conception d''API RESTful","Ne prend pas en charge d''autres styles de conception d''API comme GraphQL"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Prinzipien des Designs von RESTful-APIs","Unterstützt keine anderen API-Designstile wie GraphQL"],"pt":["Limitado a princípios de design de API RESTful","Não suporta outros estilos de design de API, como GraphQL"],"ru":["Ограничен принципами проектирования RESTful API","Не поддерживает другие стили проектирования API, такие как GraphQL"],"ar":["محدود بمبادئ تصميم API RESTful","لا يدعم أنماط تصميم API أخرى مثل GraphQL"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1615f280be638223f3a3529e7067e05dabb08fc2f2a948e9239b8ba647a595dc","qualityScore":51}');
