t, simplifying the development process.","zh":"Generate Store Action 是一种用于生成 Zustand 异步操作的 AI 工具","ja":"Generate Store Action は、Zustand の非同期アクションを生成する AI エージェントの一種です","ko":"Generate Store Action은 Zustand 비동기 액션을 생성하는 AI 도구의 일종입니다","es":"generate-store-action es una habilidad que genera acciones asincrónicas de Zustand con gestión de estado de carga y error","fr":"generate-store-action est une compétence qui génère des actions asynchrones de Zustand avec gestion d''état de chargement et d''erreur","de":"generate-store-action ist eine Fähigkeit, die asynchrone Zustand-Aktionen mit Lade- und Fehlerzustandsverwaltung generiert","pt":"O Generate Store Action é uma ferramenta que gera ações assíncronas do Zustand para a loja de saúde","ru":"Generate Store Action - это инструмент, который генерирует асинхронные действия Zustand для магазина здоровья","ar":"Generate Store Action هو أداة تولد إجراءات غير متزامنة من Zustand للمتجر الصحي"},"features":{"en":["Generates Zustand async actions with loading/error state management","Supports API endpoint configuration (e.g., /api/water-intake, /api/sleep)","Handles HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) for request/response types","Enables state updates for storing data in Zustand","Follows implementation pattern based on src/lib/store/h"],"zh":["支持 Zustand 异步操作生成","实现 loading 和 error 状态管理","需要 action 名称、API 端点、HTTP 方法、请求/响应类型和状态更新","基于 src/lib/store/h 实现模式","适用于 Health Tracker 9000 开发"],"ja":["Zustand 非同期アクションの生成をサポート","ローディングとエラー状態の管理を実現","アクション名、API エンドポイント、HTTP メソッド、リクエスト/レスポンスタイプ、状態更新が必要","src/lib/store/h に基づいた実装パターン","Health Tracker 9000 開発向け"],"ko":["Zustand 비동기 액션 생성 지원","로딩 및 에러 상태 관리 구현","액션 이름, API 엔드포인트, HTTP 메소드, 요청/응답 유형, 상태 업데이트가 필요","src/lib/store/h 기반 구현 패턴","Health Tracker 9000 개발에 적합"],"es":["Generación de acciones asincrónicas de Zustand","Gestión de estado de carga y error","Compatibilidad con API endpoints y métodos HTTP","Soporte para tipos de solicitud y respuesta","Actualizaciones de estado en Zustand"],"fr":["Génération d''actions asynchrones de Zustand","Gestion d''état de chargement et d''erreur","Compatibilité avec les points de terminaison API et les méthodes HTTP","Prise en charge des types de requête et de réponse","Mises à jour d''état dans Zustand"],"de":["Generierung asynchroner Zustand-Aktionen","Verwaltung von Lade- und Fehlerzuständen","Kompatibilität mit API-Endpunkten und HTTP-Methoden","Unterstützung für Anfrage- und Antworttypen","Zustandsaktualisierungen in Zustand"],"pt":["Geração de ações assíncronas do Zustand","Gerenciamento de estado de carregamento/erro","Integração com API endpoints","Suporte a HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)","Atualizações de estado personalizadas"],"ru":["Генерация асинхронных действий Zustand","Управление состоянием загрузки/ошибки","Интеграция с API endpoints","Поддержка HTTP методов (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)","Пользовательские обновления состояния"],"ar":["توليد إجراءات غير متزامنة من Zustand","إدارة حالة التحميل/الخطأ","التكامل مع نهاية API","دعم أساليب HTTP (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)","تحديثات حالة مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use generate-store-action","generate-store-action alternative","generate-store-action install","what is generate-store-action","generate-store-action vs Redux","generate-store-action setup guide","Zustand async action generation","health-tracker-9000 development"],"zh":["Zustand 异步操作","Health Tracker 9000","AI 工具","状态管理","loading 状态","error 状态","API 端点","HTTP 方法"],"ja":["Zustand 非同期アクション","Health Tracker 9000","AI エージェント","状態管理","ローディング状態","エラー状態","API エンドポイント","HTTP メソッド"],"ko":["Zustand 비동기 액션","Health Tracker 9000","AI 도구","상태 관리","로딩 상태","에러 상태","API 엔드포인트","HTTP 메소드"],"es":["generate-store-action","Zustand","acciones asincrónicas","gestión de estado de carga y error","API endpoints","métodos HTTP","tipos de solicitud y respuesta","Herramientas de desarrollo de AI"],"fr":["generate-store-action","Zustand","actions asynchrones","gestion d''état de chargement et d''erreur","points de terminaison API","méthodes HTTP","types de requête et de réponse","Outils de développement d''IA"],"de":["generate-store-action","Zustand","asynchrone Aktionen","Verwaltung von Lade- und Fehlerzuständen","API-Endpunkte","HTTP-Methoden","Anfrage- und Antworttypen","KI-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Generate Store Action","Zustand","ações assíncronas","gerenciamento de estado","API endpoints","HTTP methods","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Generate Store Action","Zustand","асинхронные действия","управление состоянием","API endpoints","HTTP методы","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Generate Store Action","Zustand","إجراءات غير متزامنة","إدارة حالة","نهاية API","أساليب HTTP","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"marcd35","repo":"health-tracker-9000","repoPath":"marcd35/health-tracker-9000","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.353Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-store-action","description":"Generate Zustand async action with loading/error states and toast notifications. Use when adding new API calls to the health store.","bodyPreview":"# Generate Store Action\n\nGenerate a Zustand async action for the health store with loading/error state management.\n\n## Usage\n\nWhen user requests to add a store action, ask for:\n\n1. **Action name** (e.g., \"fetchWaterLogs\", \"addSleepLog\", \"updateWeight\")\n2. **API endpoint** (e.g., \"/api/water-intake\", \"/api/sleep\")\n3. **HTTP method** (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)\n4. **Request/response types**\n5. **State updates** needed (what gets stored in Zustand)\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\nBased on `src/lib/store/h","body":"# Generate Store Action\n\nGenerate a Zustand async action for the health store with loading/error state management.\n\n## Usage\n\nWhen user requests to add a store action, ask for:\n\n1. **Action name** (e.g., \"fetchWaterLogs\", \"addSleepLog\", \"updateWeight\")\n2. **API endpoint** (e.g., \"/api/water-intake\", \"/api/sleep\")\n3. **HTTP method** (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)\n4. **Request/response types**\n5. **State updates** needed (what gets stored in Zustand)\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\nBased on `src/lib/store/healthStore.ts` existing patterns.\n\n### Pattern Structure\n\nAdd to existing store in `src/lib/store/healthStore.ts`:\n\n```typescript\n// In HealthState interface:\ninterface HealthState {\n  // ... existing state ...\n  waterLogs: WaterLog[];\n\n  // ... existing actions ...\n  fetchWaterLogs: (date: string) => Promise<void>;\n  addWaterLog: (log: Omit<WaterLog, ''id'' | ''createdAt''>) => Promise<void>;\n  deleteWaterLog: (id: string) => Promise<void>;\n}\n\n// In the store creation:\nexport const useHealthStore = create<HealthState>((set, get) => ({\n  // ... existing state ...\n  waterLogs: [],\n\n  // ... existing actions ...\n\n  fetchWaterLogs: async (date: string) => {\n    set({ isLoading: true, error: null });\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(`/api/water-intake?date=${date}`);\n      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(''Failed to fetch water logs'');\n      const data = await response.json();\n      set({ waterLogs: data, isLoading: false });\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      set({ error: err.message, isLoading: false });\n      toast.error(err.message || ''Failed to fetch water logs'');\n    }\n  },\n\n  addWaterLog: async (log: Omit<WaterLog, ''id'' | ''createdAt''>) => {\n    set({ isLoading: true, error: null });\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(''/api/water-intake'', {\n        method: ''POST'',\n        headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n        body: JSON.stringify(log),\n      });\n      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(''Failed to add water log'');\n      const newLog = await response.json();\n      set({\n        waterLogs: [...get().waterLogs, newLog],\n        isLoading: false,\n      });\n      toast.success(''Water intake logged'');\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      set({ error: err.message, isLoading: false });\n      toast.error(err.message || ''Failed to add water log'');\n    }\n  },\n\n  deleteWaterLog: async (id: string) => {\n    set({ isLoading: true, error: null });\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch(`/api/water-intake?id=${id}`, {\n        method: ''DELETE'',\n      });\n      if (!response.ok) throw new Error(''Failed to delete water log'');\n      set({\n        waterLogs: get().waterLogs.filter((log) => log.id !== id),\n        isLoading: false,\n      });\n      toast.success(''Water log deleted'');\n    } catch (err: any) {\n      set({ error: err.message, isLoading: false });\n      toast.error(err.message || ''Failed to delete water log'');\n    }\n  },\n}));\n```\n\n## Key Conventions\n\n- Always wrap in `set({ isLoading: true, error: null })`\n- Use `await fetch()` with proper method and headers\n- Check `!response.ok` to handle HTTP errors\n- Parse response with `await response.json()`\n- Use `get()` to access current state in actions\n- Update state with `set()` including `isLoading: false`\n- Call `toast.success()` on success\n- Call `toast.error()` on failure\n- Include error message in toast: `err.message || ''Default message''`\n- For arrays: use spread operator to create new array\n- State updates are immutable (don''t mutate existing state)\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Ask user for action name, API endpoint, method, and types\n2. Open `src/lib/store/healthStore.ts`\n3. Add action type to HealthState interface\n4. Add initial state if needed (empty array, null, etc.)\n5. Implement action function following the pattern above\n6. Include proper error handling and toast notifications\n7. Format with Prettier\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Action added to HealthState interface\n- [ ] Initial state added if new data field\n- [ ] Async action with try-catch\n- [ ] Loading state managed (set/unset)\n- [ ] Error state managed\n- [ ] API endpoint correct\n- [ ] HTTP method correct\n- [ ] Response validation (!response.ok)\n- [ ] Toast notifications added\n- [ ] State updates are immutable\n- [ ] get() used to access current state\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:57.838Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents working with Zustand and API endpoints, seeking to streamline store action creation.","zh":"适合使用Zustand和API端点的全栈代理，旨在简化存储动作创建。","ja":"ZustandとAPIエンドポイントを使用するフルスタックエージェントに適しています。ストアアクションの作成を簡素化することを目指しています。","ko":"Zustand와 API 엔드포인트를 사용하는 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 스토어 액션 생성을 간소화하려는 목적으로 설계되었습니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Full Stack que trabajan con Zustand y puntos de conexión de API, que buscan simplificar la creación de acciones de almacenamiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full Stack travaillant avec Zustand et les points de terminaison d''API, cherchant à rationaliser la création d''actions de stock.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die mit Zustand und API-Endpunkten arbeiten und die Erstellung von Store-Aktionen rationalisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que trabalham com Zustand e endpoints de API, buscando simplificar a criação de ações de armazenamento.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полноценных агентов, работающих с Zustand и конечными точками API, стремящихся оптимизировать создание действий хранилища.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطبيق الكامل الذي يعمل مع Zustand ونقاط النهاية API ، يسعى إلى简ification إنشاء إجراءات المتجر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Zustand async actions with loading and error state management, utilizing API endpoints and supporting HTTP methods like GET, POST, PUT, and DELETE, while handling request and response types for seamless state updates in Zustand.","zh":"赋予代理生成Zustand异步动作的能力，包括加载和错误状态管理，利用API端点并支持HTTP方法，如GET、POST、PUT和DELETE，同时处理请求和响应类型以实现Zustand中的无缝状态更新。","ja":"エージェントにZustandの非同期アクションを生成する能力を付与し、ローディングとエラーステート管理を含み、APIエンドポイントを利用し、HTTPメソッド（GET、POST、PUT、DELETE）をサポートし、Zustandでのシームレスなステート更新のためにリクエストとレスポンスタイプを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Zustand의 비동기 액션을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 로딩 및 오류 상태 관리를 포함하고, API 엔드포인트를 활용하며, HTTP 메서드(GIT, POST, PUT, DELETE)를 지원하며, Zustand의 무결점 상태 업데이트를 위해 요청 및 응답 유형을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar acciones asíncronas de Zustand con gestión de estado de carga y error, utilizando puntos de conexión de API y admitiendo métodos HTTP como GET, POST, PUT y DELETE, mientras maneja tipos de solicitudes y respuestas para actualizaciones de estado sin problemas en Zustand.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des actions asynchrones Zustand avec gestion de l''état de chargement et d''erreur, en utilisant des points de terminaison d''API et en prenant en charge les méthodes HTTP comme GET, POST, PUT et DELETE, tout en gérant les types de requêtes et de réponses pour des mises à jour d''état sans problème dans Zustand.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, asynchrone Zustand-Aktionen mit Lade- und Fehlerzustandsverwaltung zu generieren, indem API-Endpunkte verwendet und HTTP-Methoden wie GET, POST, PUT und DELETE unterstützt werden, während Anfrage- und Antworttypen für nahtlose Zustandsaktualisierungen in Zustand verarbeitet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar ações assíncronas do Zustand com gerenciamento de estado de carregamento e erro, utilizando endpoints de API e suportando métodos HTTP como GET, POST, PUT e DELETE, além de lidar com tipos de solicitação e resposta para atualizações de estado sem problemas no Zustand.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать асинхронные действия Zustand с управлением состоянием загрузки и ошибки, используя конечные точки API и поддерживая методы HTTP, такие как GET, POST, PUT и DELETE, а также обрабатывая типы запросов и ответов для бесшовных обновлений состояния в Zustand.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء إجراءات غير متزامنة ل Zustand مع إدارة حالة التحميل وخطأ ، باستخدام نقاط النهاية API ودعم طرق HTTP مثل GET و POST و PUT و DELETE ، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع أنواع الطلب والاستجابة لتحديثات الحالة دون مشاكل في Zustand."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating async actions for health store management","Creating store actions with loading and error state management","Streamlining API endpoint interactions with Zustand","Automating state updates in Zustand based on API responses"],"zh":["为健康存储管理生成异步动作","创建具有加载和错误状态管理的存储动作","简化Zustand与API端点的交互","根据API响应自动更新Zustand中的状态"],"ja":["ヘルスストア管理のための非同期アクションの生成","ローディングとエラーステート管理を含むストアアクションの作成","ZustandとAPIエンドポイントの相互作用の簡素化","APIレスポンスに基づくZustandでのステートの自動更新"],"ko":["헬스 스토어 관리를 위한 비동기 액션 생성","로딩 및 오류 상태 관리를 포함하는 스토어 액션 생성","Zustand와 API 엔드포인트의 상호작용을 간소화","API 응답에 따라 Zustand의 상태를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것"],"es":["Generación de acciones asíncronas para la gestión del almacén de salud","Creación de acciones de almacenamiento con gestión de estado de carga y error","Simplificación de las interacciones con puntos de conexión de API con Zustand","Automatización de actualizaciones de estado en Zustand en función de respuestas de API"],"fr":["Génération d''actions asynchrones pour la gestion du magasin de santé","Création d''actions de stock avec gestion de l''état de chargement et d''erreur","Rationalisation des interactions avec les points de terminaison d''API avec Zustand","Automatisation des mises à jour d''état dans Zustand en fonction des réponses d''API"],"de":["Erzeugung asynchroner Aktionen für die Verwaltung des Gesundheitsstores","Erstellung von Store-Aktionen mit Lade- und Fehlerzustandsverwaltung","Vereinfachung der Interaktionen mit API-Endpunkten mit Zustand","Automatisierung von Zustandsaktualisierungen in Zustand basierend auf API-Antworten"],"pt":["Geração de ações assíncronas para gerenciamento de armazenamento de saúde","Criação de ações de armazenamento com gerenciamento de estado de carregamento e erro","Otimização das interações com endpoints de API com Zustand","Automatização de atualizações de estado em Zustand com base em respostas de API"],"ru":["Генерация асинхронных действий для управления хранилищем здоровья","Создание действий хранилища с управлением состоянием загрузки и ошибки","Оптимизация