INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('penne-0505/minecraft_landing_page/systematic-debugging', 'systematic-debugging', 'penne-0505', 'minecraft_landing_page', 'community', 'systematic-debugging penne-0505 minecraft_landing_page community Systematic debugging is a methodical approach to identifying and fixing technical issues, benefiting developers by ensuring they address the root cause of problems, not just symptoms. 系统调试是快速找到问题根因并解决的方法，遵循铁律：无根因调查则无修复 体系的デバッグは問題の根拠を迅速に特定して解決する方法で、鉄則：根拠を調査せずに修復はできない 시스템 디버깅은 문제의 근본 원인을迅速하게 찾아내어 해결하는 방법으로 철법：근본 원인을 조사하지 않고는 수정할 수 없다 La depuración sistemática es un enfoque metodológico para identificar y solucionar problemas técnicos. Siempre encuentra la causa raíz antes de intentar soluciones. Le débogage systématique est une approche méthodologique pour identifier et résoudre les problèmes techniques. Toujours trouver la cause profonde avant de tenter des solutions. Die systematische Fehlersuche ist ein methodischer Ansatz zur Identifizierung und Lösung von technischen Problemen. Immer die Ursache finden, bevor Sie Lösungen versuchen. A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem que visa encontrar a causa raiz dos problemas, evitando soluções rápidas e ineficazes. Системная отладка - это подход, направленный на выявление коренной причины проблем, а не на быстрые и неэффективные решения. التصحيح المنهجي هو نهج يهدف الى ايجاد السبب الجذري للمشاكل، وتجنب الحلول السريعة والغير فعالة. how to use systematic debugging what is systematic debugging systematic debugging vs trial and error systematic debugging tutorial systematic debugging best practices systematic debugging for bug fixing systematic debugging alternative approaches systematic debugging setup guide systematic debugging install and configure 系统调试 AIエージェント 问题根因 铁律 测试失败 bug 技术问题 Enforces the core principle of finding root causes before applying fixes Operates under the Iron Law: NO FIXES WITHOUT ROOT CAUSE INVESTIGATION FIRST Applies to any technical issue, including test failures and bugs Ensures that symptom fixes are avoided to prevent new bugs Requires completion of Phase 1 investigation before proposing fixes Supports systematic analysis for thorough issue resolution Systematic debugging is a disciplined approach to debugging that emphasizes finding the root cause of issues before attempting fixes.');
