INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Hypogenic-AI/news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude/paper-finder', 'paper-finder', 'Hypogenic-AI', 'news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude', 'community', 'paper-finder Hypogenic-AI news-from-future-ai-aed4-claude community paper-finder facilitates systematic paper discovery and prioritization for research projects, aiding in literature reviews and methodology references. It benefits researchers and academics. Paper Finder 是一个系统化的文献发现和优先级排序工具，帮助研究人员找到相关论文和基线论文 Paper Finder は文献の発見と優先順位付けをシステム化したツールで、研究者が関連する論文や基線論文を探すのに役立ちます Paper Finder는 시스템화된 논문 발견 및 우선순위 지정 도구로 연구자가 관련 논문 및 기준 논문을 찾는 데 도움을 줍니다 Paper-finder es un sistema de descubrimiento y priorización de papers de investigación de IA. Utiliza Python y CLI para encontrar papers relevantes Paper-finder est un système de découverte et de priorisation d''articles de recherche en intelligence artificielle. Il utilise Python et CLI pour trouver des articles pertinents Paper-finder ist ein System zur Entdeckung und Priorisierung von Forschungspapieren zur KI-Forschung. Es verwendet Python und CLI, um relevante Papiere zu finden O Paper Finder é uma ferramenta de pesquisa que ajuda a descobrir e priorizar artigos de pesquisa de forma sistemática Paper Finder - это инструмент для поиска научных статей, который помогает систематически обнаруживать и приоритизировать статьи أداة البحث عن الأوراق البحثية Paper Finder تساعد في اكتشاف وتحديد الأولويات البحثية بشكل منهجي how to use paper-finder paper-finder setup guide paper-finder alternative systematic paper discovery literature review tool paper-finder install what is paper-finder paper-finder vs other research tools AI 辅助文献检索 Paper Finder Python 脚本 命令行界面 文献发现 优先级排序 快速搜索 基线论文 相关论文 Utilizes the find_papers.py script for paper discovery Supports quick search mode with the --mode fast option Runs from the workspace using a Python script Facilitates building a citation list for research papers Aids in finding baseline papers for experiments paper-finder is a systematic paper discovery and prioritization tool for research projects, utilizing a helper script for efficient literature reviews');
